WARNING!  The following command line will DESTROY (not optimize)
your .A file:                             ^^^^^^^

		       O88 <MYFILE.A >MYFILE.A


I.e., do NOT use the same filename for both input and output files
when running O88 in stand-alone mode.

See the file bugfixes.lst for a history of bugs repaired.
See the file features.new for a history of new features added.
